@startuml hotel-0a-engine-class-diagram
title Hotel motor — adatmodell (a valódi szabályok alapján, 2026-07-24)

class HotelState {
  board: BoardSpace[]
  specialLanes: SpecialLane[]
  lots: HotelLot[]
  players: Player[]
  currentPlayerIndex: int
  turnPhase: TurnPhase
  lastDiceRoll: int?
  lastBuildingPermitRoll: BuildingPermitResult?
  pendingAuction: PendingAuction?
  status: HotelStatus
  winnerId: PlayerId?
}

class HotelConfig {
  id: string
  name: string
  lotPrice: int
  staircasePrice: int
  buildingPrices: int[]
  gardenPrice: int
  nightlyRates: int[][]
  gardenNightlyRates: int[]
}

class HotelLot extends HotelConfig {
  ownerId: PlayerId?
  buildingsBuilt: int
  hasGarden: boolean
  hasStaircase: boolean
  bankBuybackPrice: int?
}

class BoardSpace {
  id: string
  type: SpaceType
  adjacentLotIds: string[]
  staircaseForLotId: string?
}

class SpecialLane {
  afterSpaceIndex: int
  effect: LaneEffect
}

class Player {
  id: PlayerId
  name: string
  cash: int
  position: int
  bankrupt: boolean
}

class PendingAuction {
  lotId: string
  highestBid: int
  highestBidderId: PlayerId?
}

enum SpaceType {
  START
  PURCHASE
  CONSTRUCTION
  FREE_STAIRCASE
  FREE_BUILDING
}

enum LaneEffect {
  BONUS_2000
  STAIRCASE_PURCHASE_RIGHT
}

enum TurnPhase {
  AWAITING_ROLL
  RESOLVING_SPACE
  AWAITING_BUILDING_PERMIT
  AWAITING_NIGHTS_ROLL
  AUCTION_IN_PROGRESS
  TURN_COMPLETE
}

enum BuildingPermitResult {
  GREEN
  FREE
  DOUBLE
  RED
}

enum HotelStatus {
  IN_PROGRESS
  FINISHED
}

together {
  class RollMoveDice <<action>>
  class BuyLot <<action>> { lotId: string }
  class StartConstruction <<action>> { plan: {lotId,buildingCount}[] }
  class RollBuildingPermit <<action>>
  class TakeFreeStaircase <<action>> { lotId: string? }
  class TakeFreeBuilding <<action>> { lotId: string? }
  class RollNights <<action>>
  class BuyStaircaseRight <<action>> { lotId: string }
  class StartAuction <<action>> { lotId: string }
  class PlaceBid <<action>> { amount: int }
  class Forfeit <<action>>
  class EndTurn <<action>>
}

HotelState "1" *-- "N" BoardSpace : board
HotelState "1" *-- "N" SpecialLane : specialLanes
HotelState "1" *-- "N" HotelLot : lots
HotelState "1" *-- "N" Player : players
HotelState "0..1" *-- "1" PendingAuction : pendingAuction
HotelState --> TurnPhase
HotelState --> HotelStatus
BoardSpace --> SpaceType
SpecialLane --> LaneEffect

note right of HotelState
  Fő különbség a Dáma state-jéhez képest (két szinten is):
  1) currentPlayerIndex N-re körbefordul, átugorja a
     bankrupt=true játékosokat (nem bináris LIGHT/DARK flip)
  2) turnPhase egy több-lépéses kör-állapotgépet vezérel
     (dobás -> mező feloldása -> építési engedély/éjszaka
     dobás -> fizetés/csőd/árverés -> kör vége), NEM egyetlen
     MOVE-action, mint a Dámánál.
end note

note bottom of HotelState
  Győzelem: amikor a nem-csődbe-ment
  játékosok száma 1-re csökken ->
  status=FINISHED, winnerId beállítva.
  (Kieséses, NEM kör-limit/pontszám-alapú.)
end note

note bottom of HotelLot
  A 8 elnevezett hotel (Waikiki, Royal, L'etoile,
  Boomerang, Taj Mahal, Safari, President, Fujiyama)
  konfigurációja — pontos árak/díjak a
  hotel-0a-specifikacio.md 2. szakaszában.
end note

RollMoveDice ..> HotelState : reducer(state, action) -> HotelState
BuyLot ..> HotelState
StartConstruction ..> HotelState
RollBuildingPermit ..> HotelState
TakeFreeStaircase ..> HotelState
TakeFreeBuilding ..> HotelState
RollNights ..> HotelState
BuyStaircaseRight ..> HotelState
StartAuction ..> HotelState
PlaceBid ..> HotelState
Forfeit ..> HotelState
EndTurn ..> HotelState

@enduml
